  file stops the cycle: status `failed`); cycle 1's tournament plays it. The line's first training runs `train
  --start <version 0> --init-forget F`, which divides the start model's AdaGrad sums (LR) or counts (CNBP) by F (no
  flag when F is 1); every later one trains as any line does (`--start` the previous version, no forget). The
  line keeps its own seeds (the league's). Refused: a self-play line (its versions come from self-play), a tree kind
